5. Those with organ failure:

   1. Heart: New York Heart Association (NYHA) cardiac function class C-D;
   2. Kidney: renal failure stage and uremia stage;
   3. Lung: symptoms of respiratory failure;
   4. Brain: people with impaired consciousness.
6. Are receiving systemic steroid therapy (≥0.5mg/kg/day methylprednisolone or equivalent);
7. The toxicity or complications caused by previous intervention or treatment have not recovered to grade 2 or below (except for alopecia);
